      "title": "A bijection without double counting in the local sum",
      "statement": "Sending (a,y,[u]) to M(a,y)uK_n gives a bijection from ℤ × G_m/K_m × U/(U∩K_n) to G_n/K_n. Equality of two resulting cosets forces equality of the signed valuations and the middle cosets, followed by equality of the radical cosets relative to the fixed representatives.",
      "definitions": [
        "U has upper block triangular form with identity diagonal blocks of sizes 1,m,1.",
        "The right multiplication test for gK_n=g′K_n is g⁻¹g′∈K_n."
      ],
